Subject: [PATCH] Polish UI: kartu statistik ringkasan di Dashboard Admin, pola
 grid background konsisten di semua halaman

---
 src/pages/DashboardAdmin.jsx    | 54 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/pages/DashboardKaryawan.jsx |  3 ++
 src/pages/PengajuanIzin.jsx     | 10 +++++-
